  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Banking &amp; Financial Services - Paraguay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The advisor is assisting the Central Bank of Paraguay (CBP) with implementing a Consumer Protection Regulatory framework, including a claims, grievances, and dispute resolution. The advisor is supporting the CBP with the execution of its National Financial Inclusion Strategy, including the implementation of a regulatory framework for electronic payment systems providing mobile financial services and pre-paid cards, as well as the drafting of secured transaction reforms.</narrative>
  </description>
